# How many people have walked on the Moon?
subtitle: "Type how many people have ever walked on the Moon, then meet the first and the last, and the mission that never landed."
voices: {"a":"gemini:Aoede | a breezy quiz host; easy and warm","take":"lines"}
format: quiz

## How many people have walked on the Moon?
affirm: playful
text: {"font_size":34}
sources:
    - id: nasa
      title: Apollo program
      authors: NASA
      year: 2024
      finding: twelve astronauts walked on the Moon on six Apollo landings, Apollo 11 (July 1969) to Apollo 17 (December 1972); Apollo 13 did not land; Gene Cernan was the last to leave the surface

